Subject: [PATCH] Preserve mass Camera stylus UI using real One UI 9 View APIs

One UI 9 removed InputManager.getInstance and View.isHoveringUIEnabled. Its
global setPointerIconType replacements are no-ops, so use the anchor View's
real stylus pointer implementation. Preserve the original hover capability
predicate (S Pen hardware OR desktop mode), not the user's pen-hover setting.

